<report>
<title>Risk difference meta-analysis</title>
<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th colspan="4">Table (exposed +ve, control +ve, exposed -ve, control -ve)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="inputs"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@a</td><td>@b</td><td>@c</td><td>@d</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Risk difference</th><th colspan="2"><ci>@{pc:round2}% CI (@method)</ci></th><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{rd:roundu}</td><td><ci>@{lci:roundu}</ci></td><td><ci>@{uci:roundu}</ci></td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<table>
<tr><th>Stratum</th><th>Standardized effect</th><th>Variance</th><th colspan="2">% Weights (fixed, random)</th><th></th></tr>
<block name="differences"><tr><td>@st</td><td>@{yi:roundu}</td><td>@{vi:roundu}</td><td>@{wt:roundu}</td><td>@{dwt:roundu}</td><td>@lb</td></tr></block>
</table>

<p><u>Fixed effects (Mantel-Haenszel, Greenland-Robins)</u><br />
Pooled risk difference = @{rmh:roundu} (<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{from:roundu} to @{to:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Chi<sup>2</sup> (test risk difference differs from 0) = @{x2:roundu}  (df = @df)  <pval>@{xp:pval}</pval></p>

<p><u>Non-combinability of studies</u><br />
Cochran Q = @{qc:roundu}  (df = @df_cochran)  <pval>@{xp_cochran:pval}</pval><br />
Moment-based estimate of between studies variance = @{tausq:roundu}<br />
I<sub>2</sub> (inconsistency) = @{isq:round1}% (<ci>@{pc1:round1}% CI = @{llisq:round1}% to @{ulisq:round1}%</ci>)</p>

<p><u>Random effects (DerSimonian-Laird)</u><br />
Pooled risk difference = @{dsrd:roundu} (<ci>@{pc:round2}% CI = @{dsll:roundu} to @{dsul:roundu}</ci>)<br />
Chi<sup>2</sup> (test risk difference differs from 0) = @{dsx2:roundu}  (df = @df_ds)  <pval>@{xp_ds:pval}</pval></p>

<p><u>Bias indicators</u></p>
<block name="egger">
<p>Begg-Mazumdar: Kendall's @{tau:roundu}@{warnTooFewStrata}  <pval>@{p2:pval}</pval><br />
Egger: bias = @{a:roundu} (<ci>@{pc_egger:round2}% CI = @{cl:roundu} to @{cu:roundu}</ci>)  <pval>@{p:pval}</pval></p>
</block>
</report>
